            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Warehouse access</p>
            <p class="text-white/85 text-sm leading-relaxed">Read-only, end to end. A SQL guard limits the agent to single SELECT statements over a fixed allow-list of curated tables, with a row limit appended automatically. Snowflake and BigQuery are supported.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Model</p>
            <p class="text-white/85 text-sm leading-relaxed">Claude Sonnet 5 by default, Sonnet 4.6 selectable, routed through the Vercel AI Gateway. No static API keys in the deployment.</p>
