            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Writes and notifications</p>
            <p class="text-white/85 text-sm leading-relaxed">The model has no working write or messaging tool. Write-back and the Slack report are separate, code-controlled steps that run after the conclusion, each behind its own switch.</p>
