        <div class="max-w-xl pt-1">
          <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed mb-5">Two components. An implementation fee covers writing the data-entry tests for your systems, connecting the warehouse and the source systems, and setting up write-back, Slack and the schedule. An ongoing licence covers hosting, model usage and keeping the tests and the agent maintained.</p>
